          "_name": "image01",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image01\" group=\"Image & Video\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-4\">\n          <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/664eb88de9b0375f5d75125a-graph-p-1080-1080x619.webp\" alt=\"graph\">\n        </div>\n        <h4 class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style mb-3 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n          <b>Stitching dreams, one thread at a time.</b>\n        </h4>\n        <p class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style mb-0 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n          Unleash your creativity and sew your way to endless possibilities.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uuVD9SD7GZ",
          "_anchor": "image01-3o",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Enter your subtitle here\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">In today’s world, energy consumption is a significant part of everyday life. But as traditional energy sources become increasingly expensive and less sustainable, it’s crucial to explore alternatives that offer long-term benefits. The Energy Revolution System isn’t just a luxury; it’s a necessity for anyone looking to take control of their energy consumption, save money, and contribute to a healthier planet.<br><br>Here’s why you need the Energy Revolution System:<br><br><b>1. Slash Your Energy Bills</b><br><br>One of the biggest reasons homeowners and businesses are turning to renewable energy is the opportunity to significantly lower their electricity bills. The Energy Revolution System allows you to generate your own power, reducing the amount of energy you need to purchase from expensive utility companies. Over time, this can result in substantial savings—money that could be better spent elsewhere.<br><br><b>2. Embrace Energy Independence<br></b><br>Reliance on the traditional energy grid means your power is subject to fluctuations, outages, and price hikes. The Energy Revolution System gives you the power to generate and store your own energy, offering you independence and protection from rising utility costs. It’s a smart way to future-proof your energy needs, no matter where you live in the USA.<br><br><b>3. Reduce Your Carbon Footprint</b><br><br>If you care about the environment, the Energy Revolution System offers a sustainable solution. By shifting to renewable energy sources like solar and wind, you can drastically reduce your carbon footprint and make a positive impact on the planet. It’s a step toward fighting climate change and contributing to a cleaner, greener future for generations to come.<br><br><b>4. Increase Property Value</b><br><br>Homes and properties equipped with renewable energy systems often see an increase in value. With the Energy Revolution System, you’re not just investing in energy savings; you’re making an investment that could pay off if you decide to sell in the future. Buyers are increasingly interested in energy-efficient homes, making this an appealing feature for potential buyers.<br><br><b>5. Stay Ahead of Energy Trends</b><br><br>The energy landscape is evolving rapidly. More people are realizing that the future of energy lies in clean, renewable sources. By adopting the Energy Revolution System, you’re staying ahead of the curve. Not only will you enjoy the immediate benefits, but you’ll also be well-positioned as the world moves toward more sustainable energy practices.<br><br><b>6.</b> <b>Hassle-Free Maintenance</b><br><br>Unlike traditional energy systems that require frequent repairs and costly maintenance, the Energy Revolution System is designed to be durable, low-maintenance, and easy to operate. Once installed, you can enjoy years of hassle-free energy generation, giving you peace of mind.<br><br><b>7.</b> <b>It’s Simple to Install<br></b><br>No need for complicated setup or expert knowledge. The Energy Revolution System is designed with user-friendliness in mind, making installation quick and straightforward. This means you can start enjoying the benefits of renewable energy without a long wait or expensive installation fees.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
